records = Array[String](["DR. FARROW'S LOG\n\nThe thing under the ice knows what we will say before we say it. It drew our signal mark before we created it.", "CALLUM'S NOTE\n\nThe marks in the ice are far older than this station. The company told us to hide that fact.", "LAB REPORT\n\nEvelyn entered the room twice. The second Evelyn knew every crew member, but did not know her own room."])
